From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Subject: [PATCH] t880: complete H264 and HEVC pictures in decode order

VA clients own presentation ordering and require each submitted picture to
complete without future input. Set output reorder depth to zero only for the
T880 serializers. Preserve level-5.1 inferred H264 reference/DPB capacity and
HEVC DPB/temporal inference, using consistent VPS/SPS ordering. Leave shared
serializer defaults, slice payloads and reference semantics unchanged.

Use natural asynchronous completion for the supported H264/HEVC profiles,
including independent keys, fixed deadlines and explicit EOS restart. Test
actual generated parameter sets, POC conversion payload preservation and all
supported profiles against the production completion model.

